The underlying technique — set a named quality bar, split the work into
judgeable pieces, run a builder and a separate blind harsh critic on each,
and loop until ours wins — originates with Matt Shumer. The upstream
repository packages it as a reusable skill.

Changes in this copy: none to SKILL.md. This NOTICE was added for
attribution; the `gauntlet` subagent persona in home/agents/gauntlet.md is
original work of this repository and simply invokes the skill.
